# Contact form delivery — Web3Forms (free, no backend needed)
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter the Gmail address where you want messages delivered
# 3. Web3Forms emails you an Access Key — paste it below
# 4. Copy this file to ".env" and restart `npm run dev`
#
# For the deployed site, add the same variable in your Vercel project:
# Settings -> Environment Variables -> VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-access-key-here
